      },
      "content": {
        "block1": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "Who Can Take Part?",
          "content": "To take part in the Cycle Study, you must own a wearable device and have been diagnosed with <strong style='color:#950000;'>PMDD</strong>.<br /><br />You must also:<br />- Be <strong style='color:#e69612;'>aged 18 or over</strong><br />- Live in the UK<br />- Be fluent in English<br />- Not be on hormonal contraception<br />- Not be pregnant or breastfeeding"
        },
        "block2": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "content": "<img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RADAR-base/radar-self-enrolment-definitions/refs/heads/dev/projects/PMDD-KCL/resources/Image%202_Wearable.jpeg' alt='Wearable device' style='width:95%; border-radius:20px; box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); object-fit:cover;'/>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "column",
      "noCard": true,
      "sx": {
        "width": "100%",
        "paddingTop": "2.5rem",
        "paddingBottom": "2.5rem",
        "bgcolor": "#fff5f2",
