        }
      },
      "title": "What Happens After You Sign Up",
      "content": "<div style='background:#fffaf1; border:1px solid #f2c266; border-radius:18px; padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;'><p style='margin-top:0;'>After filling out the sign-up form, you will be asked to:</p><ul style='margin:0 0 0 1.2rem;'><li>Complete a <strong style='color:#950000;'>screening questionnaire</strong> to check eligibility</li><li>Read the Information Sheet</li><li>Provide consent</li><li>Connect your wearable so we can securely collect <strong style='color:#e69612;'>activity, sleep, and health data</strong></li><li>Complete daily and weekly questionnaires for <strong style='color:#950000;'>two menstrual cycles</strong> or a maximum of 10 weeks (whichever comes first) via the Active app</li></ul></div>"
    },
